.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-todo-done \- Mark a to-do item as done.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab todo done [] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Pass a to-do item's ID to mark that single item as done, or use
\fB--all\fR to mark every pending item as done at once.

.PP
Find item IDs with \fBglab todo list\fR\&.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Mark all pending to-do items as done.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab todo done 123
glab todo done --all

.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-todo(1)\fP
